  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3203.06 Allocation period",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3203.06 “Allocation period” means any one of 3 time periods to which allowances are allocated including the period 1999 through 2002, the period 2003 through 2005, and the period 2006 and beyond.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
